e.
 
seven-eight kilos or ten-eight kilos makes one molasses.
This is the calculation.

66
00:08:52,000 --> 00:08:57,000
Heta dimsa me frensî jî... lafan gran tir e... gran e...
 
Even our French molasses... lafan is heavier... it's
