This machine... there's only an important place in this
machine that must be clean, be clean.

70
00:09:34,000 --> 00:09:47,000
Tamam... bînê.
 
Okay... bring it.

71
00:09:47,000 --> 00:10:07,000
Maşelleh maşelleh xêr bibe.
 
Mashallah mashallah, may it be a blessing.

72
00:13:01,000 --> 00:13:03,000
Aha.
 
Aha.

73
00:13:03,000 --> 00:13:05,000
Xalo qewet be.
 
Strength to you, uncle.

74
00:13:05,000 --> 00:13:08,000
Xwedê ji te razî be xortê delal.
 
May God be pleased with you, dear young man.

75
00:13:08,000 --> 00:13:12,000
Dema te xweş be xortê, dema te xweş be, tu bi xêr hatî.
 
May your time be pleasant young man, may your time be
