81
00:13:38,000 --> 00:13:43,000
Û ev karê me... kişandina ava firingiyan e.
 
And this work of ours... is extracting tomato juice.

82
00:13:43,000 --> 00:13:48,000
Berê ev makîne tunebûn, mirov bi destan dikişand.
 
Before these machines didn't exist, people extracted it by
