84
00:13:54,000 --> 00:14:00,000
Ew jî bi gelekî westan û bi zehmetiyeke mezin.
 
And that was with a lot of tiredness and great difficulty.

85
00:14:00,000 --> 00:14:05,000
Lê niha bi xêra vê makîneyê, her tişt gelek asan bûye.
 
But now thanks to this machine, everything has become very
