86
00:14:05,000 --> 00:14:11,000
Ev makîne bacanan parçe dike, û ava wê ji aliyekî ve
derdixe.
 
This machine breaks the tomatoes, and extracts its juice
from one side.

87
00:14:11,000 --> 00:14:17,000
Û qalik û dendikê wê jî, tavêje aliyê din.
 
And it throws its peel and seeds to the other side.

88
00:14:17,000 --> 00:14:20,000
Gelo ev kar çend mehan dewam dike apê?
 
Does this work continue for how many months uncle?

89
00:14:20,000 --> 00:14:25,000
Ev kar, bi qasî sê-çar mehan dewam dike.
 
This work, continues for about three-four months.

90
00:14:25,000 --> 00:14:30,000
Di meha heşt û nehan de em dest pê dikin.
 
In the eighth and ninth month we start.

91
00:14:30,000 --> 00:14:36,000
Ev bacana dikişîne, hinara dikişîne... û hin fêkiyên din.
 
This extracts tomatoes, extracts pomegranates... and some
other fruits.

92
00:14:36,000 --> 00:14:39,000
Ji bo hinarê jî dibe na?
 
It works for pomegranates too right?

93
00:14:39,000 --> 00:14:45,000
Belê, ji bo hinarê jî dibe, lê divê em şebekeya wê
biguherînin.
 
Yes, it works for pomegranates too, but we have to change
its filter.

94
00:14:45,000 --> 00:14:51,000
Ji ber ku dendikê hinarê mezin e, û yê bacanê hûr e.
 
Because the seed of the pomegranate is big, and that of the
tomato is small.

95
00:14:51,000 --> 00:14:57,000
Eger tu şebekeya hinarê bo bacanê bixebitînî, dendik di gel
